{
  "schema": 1,
  "revision": "2026-10-29",
  "notes": [
    "Seed for ~/.local/state/awesome/models.json, copied there by `awesome-templates init`. Edit THIS file in the repo to retire/adopt a model; users pick the change up with `init --reseed`.",
    "recommended: the allowlist; a pin outside it is outdated. roles: agent role (file stem) -> cost tier. upgrade.<vendor>: tiers (tier -> model), roles (role -> model override), and families/targets/default as the fallback for roles not listed. Every model named under upgrade must be in recommended.",
    "copilot names are the display names from docs.github.com/en/copilot/reference/ai-models/supported-models; GitHub publishes no runtime IDs, so confirm the exact string in the Copilot CLI.",
    "live: written by `init` / `check-models --live` - per vendor {fetched_at, served[]}. Never edit by hand; never holds API keys."
  ],
